                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Looking at the playtimes of other reviews, it's obvious that there is no way this gameplay could support the kind of ~9 hour playtimes I am seeing on most of the reviews. I got tired of it in less than an hour. Especially since I hit a mission that was unsolvable due to a particle that needed to be exploded wandering off and evaporating. The games solution to these kind of problems is a \"skip mission\" button, which is good I guess?\n\nI played it a bit more, and it does get more interesting, but the interface is not great for conveying the evolution of the particles and such, plus I'm just kind of dumb, so it's hard for me to figure out what to do. Oftentimes a mission just randomly finishes and I'm not sure what I did to meet the requirements.",
